      "code": "abstract_table_time_to_stable_hcv_tension",
      "location": "Abstract Results vs Table 3",
      "message": "The abstract states all patients took >48 h to reach stable HCV, while Table 3 reports IQR lower bounds below 48 h (34.4 h and 30.4 h). Both source assertions were preserved; no reconciliation was invented."
    }
